third_party/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local and operational state. None of this belongs in git.
#
# Added 2026-08-12 after two "Sync between Local and VM" commits swept an
# entire VM home directory into history -- ~54,000 files including six
# credential files, a live PostgreSQL data directory and seven blobs over
# GitHub's 100 MB per-file limit, which made the branch unpushable. Those
# commits were dropped; these rules stop it recurring.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Secrets -- never commit. Real values live in /home/developer/*.env on the VM.
.env
*.env
.smbcredentials
*.pem
*.key
id_rsa*

# Python environments and bytecode (each module keeps its own venv, per CLAUDE.md)
venv/
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo

# Databases and dumps. The operational DB is PostgreSQL on the VM; the frozen
# SQLite QR_codes.db is a rollback reference, not a source artifact.
*.db
*.dump
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
QR_database/pgdata/
QR_database/backups/
QR_database/source_snapshot.db

# Captured images and extraction payloads -- operational data stores
Capture_photos_upload/
Output_jason_api/
SDI_process/sdi_json_output/

# Logs
logs/
*.log

# Backup and staging trees (the *.bak_YYYYMMDD_HHMMSS convention plus the
# deploy snapshot directories -- all are copies of files already tracked)
*.bak
*.bak.*
*.bak_*
*.preflip_bak_*
backups/
backup_app/
db_backups/
deploy_backups/
.deploy_backups/
deploy_staging/
deploy_review_status_*/
_retired_nested_git_*/

# Tooling and editor state that leaked in from the VM home directory.
# Scoped to the session/cache subtrees so .claude/settings.json and friends
# stay committable -- the 250-276 MB blobs were all under .claude/remote/.
.claude/remote/
.claude/projects/
.claude/todos/
.claude/shell-snapshots/
.claude/statsig/
.claude.json
.cache/
.vscode-server/
.local/
.npm/
.dotnet/
.config/
Thumbs.db
